2026-10-17T00:44:59.8878481Z             "Canonical synthetic account/session setup proves authorization and persisted membership; it does not grant owner acceptance, camera/native spatial capability or real-phone proof.",
2026-10-17T00:44:59.8878946Z             "Actual two-context pairing, handoff acknowledgement, revocation and restricted shared-display privacy remain covered by the dedicated browser specification; the single-context capture signs in and registers through the actual product UI.",
2026-10-17T00:44:59.8879523Z             "The existing canonical profile control supplies a rendered person witness; authenticated API/session checks bind it to the actual synthetic account. The final exact Voyage path proves contextual re-entry. Ordinary anonymous account-recovery obligations remain unchanged in their existing contract.",
2026-10-17T00:44:59.8879980Z             "The existing generic seed owns only a deterministic synthetic account and persisted edition in a guarded nonce database; real sign-in, authorization and device registration establish each capture surface without injected cookies or tab storage.",
2026-10-17T00:44:59.8880560Z             "The guarded persisted fixture represents an already-opened active Voyage. Every primary entry waits for visible Journal tools, and companion return proves the canonical returning Journal and its replay control rather than assuming a first-open dialog in each signed-in context.",
2026-10-17T00:44:59.8881170Z             "The same synthetic canonical account owns its primary email, one verified secondary email and existing-style Player username. Six-contract captures retain all twenty desktop/mobile and normal/reduced contexts while respecting the unchanged six-per-login sign-in guard; no account/session injection or auth bypass is used."
